IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ma-types`
IMPORT `ma-schedules`
IMPORT `ma-units`
IMPORT `ma-conversion`
IMPORT `ma-orders-saving`
IMPORT `ma-goal`

-- Metrication Act 1970 — TESTS OF THE GOAL-LEVEL CONCLUSIONS.
-- Expected values worked by hand from ../source/MA1970.txt (ss 2-7 and the
-- Schedules).

§ `Tests — the goals`

§§ `Goal 1 — SI status (ss 2, 3(2))`

#ASSERT `the SI status of` metre `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` FALSE EQUALS `SI status` OF TRUE, `a basic unit`, JUST "m", JUST "length"
#ASSERT `the SI status of` volt `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` FALSE EQUALS `SI status` OF TRUE, `a supplementary or derived unit`, JUST "V", JUST "electric tension, potential difference, electromotive force"
#ASSERT `the SI status of` litre `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` FALSE EQUALS `SI status` OF TRUE, `a unit used in conjunction with them`, JUST "L", JUST "volume"
-- s 2(1)(b): the context of a written law excludes the Fourth Schedule units
#ASSERT (`the SI status of` litre `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` TRUE)'s `role` EQUALS `not a unit of the International System`
#ASSERT NOT (`the SI status of` litre `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` TRUE)'s `a unit of the International System of Units`
#ASSERT `the SI status of` yard `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` FALSE EQUALS `SI status` OF FALSE, `not a unit of the International System`, NOTHING, NOTHING

§§ `Goal 2 — legal force (ss 3(1), 7(2))`

#ASSERT `the legal force of using` metre `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` FALSE `, on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, lawful under another system:` FALSE EQUALS `legal force and validity under s 3(1)`
-- the day s 3(1) begins, and the day before
#ASSERT `the legal force of using` metre `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` FALSE `, on` (YMD 1971 2 15) `, lawful under another system:` FALSE EQUALS `legal force and validity under s 3(1)`
#ASSERT `the legal force of using` metre `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` FALSE `, on` (YMD 1971 2 14) `, lawful under another system:` FALSE EQUALS `no legal force from this Act`
#ASSERT `the legal force of using` metre `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` FALSE `, on` (YMD 1971 2 14) `, lawful under another system:` TRUE EQUALS `its own legal force, preserved by s 7(2)`
#ASSERT `the legal force of using` kati `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` FALSE `, on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, lawful under another system:` TRUE EQUALS `its own legal force, preserved by s 7(2)`
#ASSERT `the legal force of using` kati `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` FALSE `, on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, lawful under another system:` FALSE EQUALS `no legal force from this Act`
#ASSERT `the legal force of using` hectare `, the context excluding the Fourth Schedule:` TRUE `, on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, lawful under another system:` FALSE EQUALS `no legal force from this Act`

§§ `Goal 3 — conversion (s 5, Third Schedule)`

-- 10 yards x 0.9144 = 9.144 metres, exactly; an imperial standard (s 5(a))
#ASSERT `the conversion of` 10 yard EQUALS `Converted value` OF 9.144, "metre", TRUE, `an imperial standard of extension, weight or capacity`
-- 2 kati x 0.604790 = 1.20958 kilogram, approximately; local customary (s 5(b))
#ASSERT `the conversion of` 2 kati EQUALS `Converted value` OF 1.20958, "kilogram", FALSE, `the local customary system of weights and measures`
-- 5 chhek x 0.37465 = 1.87325 metres, exactly
#ASSERT (`the conversion of` 5 chhek)'s `SI value` EQUALS 1.87325
#ASSERT (`the conversion of` 5 chhek)'s `exact`
-- 3 gallons x 4.54609 = 13.63827 litres, approximately
#ASSERT (`the conversion of` 3 gallon)'s `SI value` EQUALS 13.63827
#ASSERT NOT (`the conversion of` 3 gallon)'s `exact`
#ASSERT REFUSED `the conversion of` 5 metre

§§ `Goal 4 — orders and the saving (ss 4, 7(1))`

#ASSERT `the outcome of a challenge to an act done on` (YMD 2000 1 1) `, the s 4 order made on` (JUST (YMD 2005 1 1)) `, on the units ground only:` TRUE EQUALS `barred by s 7(1)`
#ASSERT `the outcome of a challenge to an act done on` (YMD 2010 1 1) `, the s 4 order made on` (JUST (YMD 2005 1 1)) `, on the units ground only:` TRUE EQUALS `not barred: the act was done after the order`
-- an act done on the day of the order is not "before the making" of it
#ASSERT `the outcome of a challenge to an act done on` (YMD 2005 1 1) `, the s 4 order made on` (JUST (YMD 2005 1 1)) `, on the units ground only:` TRUE EQUALS `not barred: the act was done after the order`
#ASSERT `the outcome of a challenge to an act done on` (YMD 2000 1 1) `, the s 4 order made on` (JUST (YMD 2005 1 1)) `, on the units ground only:` FALSE EQUALS `not barred: the challenge rests on other grounds too`
#ASSERT `the outcome of a challenge to an act done on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, the s 4 order made on` NOTHING `, on the units ground only:` TRUE EQUALS `barred by s 7(1)`
#ASSERT count `provisions carried as text` EQUALS 3

§§ `The top-level goal`

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER, u IS A Unit, d IS A DATE, excl IS A BOOLEAN, lawful IS A BOOLEAN, o IS A MAYBE DATE, only IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Measurement
`a measurement of` a u d excl lawful o only MEANS
    Measurement WITH
        `amount` IS a
        `unit` IS u
        `used on` IS d
        `the context excludes the Fourth Schedule` IS excl
        `the use is lawful in Singapore under another system` IS lawful
        `the s 4 order touching it was made on` IS o
        `challenged only on the units ground` IS only

-- 100 kati in 2026, lawful locally, no s 4 order yet: not SI; saved by s 7(2);
-- 100 x 0.604790 = 60.479 kg, approximately; a challenge on units alone is barred
`a shop's 100 kati` MEANS `a measurement of` 100 kati (YMD 2026 1 1) FALSE TRUE NOTHING TRUE
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `a shop's 100 kati`)'s `legal force of the use` EQUALS `its own legal force, preserved by s 7(2)`
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `a shop's 100 kati`)'s `amount in SI units` EQUALS JUST 60.479
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `a shop's 100 kati`)'s `SI unit of that amount` EQUALS JUST "kilogram"
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `a shop's 100 kati`)'s `conversion exact` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `a shop's 100 kati`)'s `a challenge on the units ground alone` EQUALS `barred by s 7(1)`

-- 5 metres in 2026: SI, s 3(1); the amount is already SI; nothing to convert; s 7(1) not needed
`5 metres` MEANS `a measurement of` 5 metre (YMD 2026 1 1) FALSE FALSE NOTHING TRUE
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `5 metres`)'s `legal force of the use` EQUALS `legal force and validity under s 3(1)`
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `5 metres`)'s `amount in SI units` EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `5 metres`)'s `SI unit of that amount` EQUALS JUST "m"
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `5 metres`)'s `conversion exact` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `5 metres`)'s `a challenge on the units ground alone` EQUALS `not applicable: the act was done in an SI unit`

-- a unit no Schedule names, not lawfully used: no force from the Act; no SI amount
`10 of another unit` MEANS `a measurement of` 10 `another unit` (YMD 2026 1 1) FALSE FALSE (JUST (YMD 2020 1 1)) TRUE
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `10 of another unit`)'s `legal force of the use` EQUALS `no legal force from this Act`
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `10 of another unit`)'s `amount in SI units` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `10 of another unit`)'s `a challenge on the units ground alone` EQUALS `not barred: the act was done after the order`

-- 2 hectares where the law's context excludes the Fourth Schedule: not SI there,
-- and the Third Schedule gives no conversion
`2 hectares, excluded` MEANS `a measurement of` 2 hectare (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE FALSE NOTHING TRUE
#ASSERT NOT ((`the metrication position for` `2 hectares, excluded`)'s `SI status`)'s `a unit of the International System of Units`
#ASSERT (`the metrication position for` `2 hectares, excluded`)'s `amount in SI units` EQUALS NOTHING
